                "loc": "NUM.26.1+NUM.26.2+NUM.26.3+NUM.26.4+NUM.26.5+NUM.26.6+NUM.26.7+NUM.26.8+NUM.26.9+NUM.26.10+NUM.26.11+NUM.26.12+NUM.26.13+NUM.26.14+NUM.26.15+NUM.26.16+NUM.26.17+NUM.26.18+NUM.26.19+NUM.26.20+NUM.26.21+NUM.26.22+NUM.26.23+NUM.26.24+NUM.26.25+NUM.26.26+NUM.26.27+NUM.26.28+NUM.26.29+NUM.26.30+NUM.26.31+NUM.26.32+NUM.26.33+NUM.26.34+NUM.26.35+NUM.26.36+NUM.26.37+NUM.26.38+NUM.26.39+NUM.26.40+NUM.26.41+NUM.26.42+NUM.26.43+NUM.26.44+NUM.26.45+NUM.26.46+NUM.26.47+NUM.26.48+NUM.26.49+NUM.26.50+NUM.26.51"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Khub. 26.1-51",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi alomaloma ne Musa mu sichiimi sia Sinai. Aalomaloma ne naye mwiiema lie kumuse khu ndaalo eye khunyoa, eye kumwesi kwe khabili kwe kumwiiko kwe khabili, enyuma we Baisiraeli khurura mu sibala sia Misiri. Aboolela Musa ali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bala babaandu ba Isiraeli boosi, khuloondekhana ne luuya ne chinju chabwe. Babale khuloondekhana ne bukali bwabwe, buli owe siseecha, mulala sia mulala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bala buli owe siseecha owe bukhulu bwe kimiiko kamakhumi kabili namwe khukhilakhoo. Bala boosi mu Isiraeli banyala bacha mwiie, ewe ne Aruni, sipupu ne sipupu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Reeba omwimeelesi owa buli luuya khukhwama buli mu kholo akhuyeete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kano niko kamasina ke babaandu bakhakhuyeete. Khukhwama mu kholo eya Rubeni, Elisuri okhwa Sheteuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khukhwama mu kholo eya Simioni, Shelumieli okhwa Surisiatai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khukhwama mu kholo eya Yuda, Nasioni okhwa Aminatabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khukhwama mu kholo eya Isakari, Netaneli okhwa Suari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khukhwama mu kholo eya Sebuluni, Eliabu okhwa Heloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khukhwama mu baana ba Yosefu, mu kholo eya Efuraimu, Elisiama okhwa Amihudi, ne khukhwama mu kholo eya Manase, Kamalieli okhwa Petausuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khukhwama mu kholo eya Benjamini, Abitani okhwa Gidioni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khukhwama mu kholo eya Dani, Aieseri okhwa Amisiatai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khukhwama mu kholo eya Asieri, Pakieli okhwa Okirani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khukhwama mu kholo eya Kati, Eliasafu okhwa Teueli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khukhwama mu kholo eya Nafutali, Aira okhwa Enani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bano nibo babaroborwa khukhwama mu baandu ba Isiraeli. Baba babemeelesi be chikholo chabwe lundi babemeelesi be chinju cha Isiraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa ne Aruni, babukula babaandu babaroborwa bano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mala khu ndaalo enyoa eye kumwesi kukhola khabili, babuusia babaandu boosi, ba andika kamasina kabwe khuloondekhana ne luuya ne chinju. Kamasina ke babaandu be siseecha be bukhulu bwe kimiiko kamakhumi kabili namwe khukhilakhoo, baandikwa, mulala sia mulala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa akhola nga Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi ne alaka. Abalila babaandu mu sichiimi sia Sinai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekholo eya Rubeni, omubele owa Yakobo babalwa. Be siseecha boosi, babanyala khucha liie mala ba baba ne bukhulu bwe kimiiko kamakhumi kabili ne khukhilakhoo babalwa. Babalwa khuloondekhana ne luuya ne chinju chabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babaandu be ekholo eya Rubeni baba chielefu arubaine na sita ne chimia chiraano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekholo eya Simioni babalwa. Babaandu boosi be siseecha be bukhulu bwe kimiiko kamakhumi kabili ne khukhilakhoo, abo ba baaba banyala khucha mwiie. Babalwa mulala sia mulala khuloondekhana ne luuya ne chinju chabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekholo eya Simioni yaba chielefu khamusini na tisa ne chimia chitaru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekholo eya Kati ebalwa. Babalwa be siseecha boosi be bukhulu bwe kimiiko kamakhumi kabili ne khukhilakho, ba baaba banyala khucha mwiie. Babalwa mulala sia mulala khuloondekhana ne luuya ne chinju chabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekholo eya Kati yoosi yaba chielefu arubaine natano ne chimia sita ne kamakhumi karaano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekholo eya Yuda babalwa. Babalwa be siseecha boosi ba baaba bukhulu bwe kimiiko kamakhumi kabili ne khukhilakhoo, ba baaba banyala khucha mwiie. Babalwa mulala sia mulala khuloondekhana ne luuya ne chinju chabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekholo eya Yuda boosi baba chielefu sabini naine ne chimia sita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekholo eya Isakari babalwa. Babalwa be siseecha boosi ba baaba bukhulu bwe kimiiko kamakhumi kabili ne khukhilakhoo, lundi ba baaba banyala khucha mwiie. Babalwa mulala sia mulala khuloondekhana ne luuya ne chinju chabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekholo eya Isakari baba babaandu chielefu khamusini naine ne chimia chine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekholo eya Sebuluni babalwa. Babalwa be siseecha boosi ba baaba ne bukhulu bwe kimiiko kamakhumi kabili ne khukhilakhoo lundi babanyala khucha mwiie. Babalwa mulala sia mulala khuloondekhana ne luuya ne chinju chabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
