          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekholo eya Dani babalwa. Babalwa be siseecha boosi ba baaba ne bukhulu bwe kimiiko kamakhumi kabili ne khukhilakhoo lundi ba baaba banyala khucha mwiie. Babalwa khuloondekhana ne luuya ne chinju chabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
